saline 0.9%         1000 mL over 8h00:  42 drops/min (20 gtt/mL), pump 125 mL/h, 08:00 to 16:00
glucose 5%           500 mL over 4h00:  31 drops/min (15 gtt/mL), pump 125 mL/h, 13:30 to 17:30
antibiotic           100 mL over 0h30:  67 drops/min (20 gtt/mL), pump 200 mL/h, 18:00 to 18:30
child maintenance    250 mL over 10h00:  25 drops/min (60 gtt/mL), pump 25 mL/h, 21:00 to 07:00
1 order uses a micro-drip set
